/* Predicate names that nest (bb1 inside state_bb1).
   Until 2026-09-05 Ident.is_related_tvar related U_state_bb1_ to bb1 by the substring _bb1_,
   so the partial-solution exchange between MuVal's primal and dual domains could attribute a
   candidate to the wrong predicate.  Expected: valid. */
forall (x: int). x >= 0 => state_bb1 x
s.t.
state_bb1 (x: int): bool =nu bb1 x /\ state_bb1 (x + 1);
bb1 (x: int): bool =mu x >= 0 \/ bb1 (x + 1);
